# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Ibisohoka andika: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), umurongo-mushya.
Ibisohoka andika: ([''] tccompare: ['']), umurongo-mushya.
